## Scope

This MIT license covers this project's own original work: `setup.sh`,
`lib/*.sh` (excluding the vendored file noted below), `events.d/Logic.tcl`,
and the dashboard pages written from scratch for this fork (`qsolog/`,
`tgnames/`, `help/`, the rewritten `backup/`, and the security/correctness
fixes applied throughout).

It does not — and cannot — extend new rights to two things this project
builds on:

- **`dashboard/`'s base pages** are forked from
  [Guru-RF/SVXLink-Dash-V2](https://github.com/Guru-RF/SVXLink-Dash-V2),
  itself downstream of earlier work by ON3URE, G4NAB, SP2ONG, and SP0DZ.
  None of these publish a license file; by the ham radio community's own
  long-standing informal norm, this lineage is shared freely for
  non-commercial amateur radio use, and this fork continues under that same
  understanding rather than asserting terms the upstream authors never
  granted.
- **`lib/rx-monitor/proxy.js`** is vendored unmodified from
  [DVSwitch's Web_Proxy](https://github.com/DVSwitch/DVSwitch-Dashboard)
  (Copyright (C) 2020 Mike Zingman, N4IRR and DVSwitch, INAD) and keeps its
  own header notice in full: for use on amateur radio networks only,
  educational purposes only, commercial use strictly prohibited. That
  restriction applies to this file regardless of the MIT terms above.
